{"game": "crab-champions", "language": "english", "appid": 774801, "month": "2025-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1755993600, "end_date": 1756684799, "month_true_total": 262, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-30 05:50:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "203287356", "author": {"steamid": "76561199097827019", "personaname": "AreWhyAyEn__", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199097827019/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 13028, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 619, "playtime_at_review": 7477, "last_played": 1790533407, "avatar": "d5ff90ae073ba5e89555debf1f6db98c589e0371"}, "language": "english", "review": "I invested in this game at launch, and it's always been so much fun to play. The consistent additions and updates keep it fun. You just have to play it. It's always evolving and even static now, there are so many ways to level up your gameplay, and have a new experience every time you open the game. Bravo, one of my favorite games of all time. Just buy it.", "timestamp_created": 1756681759, "timestamp_updated": 1756681759, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203287249", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038468252", "personaname": "Zounds... Peasants", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198038468252/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 359, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 359, "last_played": 1756645708, "avatar": "af6756a2af8af8d352570907747ba58a206472c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "It was a fun game for a little while, then I found out the only meta-like system that lasts between runs is unlocking new